{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-21549","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20705","text":"The [&] Protocol Ecosystem"}]},{"id":"blk-21550","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20706","text":"This repository holds the [&] Protocol specification and every in-tree reference implementation of it, plus the portfolio products that build on top. This document is the one-page tour for someone trying to understand how the pieces fit."}]},{"id":"blk-21551","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20707","text":"For authoritative status — what's shipped, what's in progress, what the test counts are — see "},{"id":"spn-20708","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"`STACK_COMPLETION.md`"},{"id":"spn-20709","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-21552","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20710","text":"The stack, in one diagram"}]},{"id":"blk-21553","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"                      ┌──────────────────────────────────────┐\n                      │   [&] Protocol — composition algebra  │\n                      │    6 primitives · 2 operators        │\n                      │    (AmpersandBoxDesign/)             │\n                      └───────────────┬──────────────────────┘\n                                      │ compiles into\n                  ┌───────────────────┴────────────────────┐\n                  │                                        │\n          ┌───────┴────────┐                      ┌────────┴────────┐\n          │   MCP runtime  │                      │  A2A coordination│\n          │   transport    │                      │    transport      │\n          └───────┬────────┘                      └─────────────────┘\n                  │\n   ┌──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────┐\n   │              │                                           │\n   │   OS protocols (OpenSentience) — 11 normative protocols  │\n   │   OS-001 Continual Learning  → Graphonomous              │\n   │   OS-002 κ-Routing           → Graphonomous              │\n   │   OS-003 Deliberation        → Graphonomous              │\n   │   OS-004 Attention           → Graphonomous              │\n   │   OS-005 Model Tier          → (system-level)            │\n   │   OS-006 Governance Shim     → delegatic                 │\n   │   OS-007 Adversarial         → (draft)                   │\n   │   OS-008 Agent Harness       → open_sentience            │\n   │   OS-009 PRISM benchmark     → PRISM                     │\n   │   OS-010 PULSE temporal      → PULSE                     │\n   │   OS-011 Embodiment          → body-browser + body-os    │\n   └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"},{"id":"blk-21554","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20711","text":"The dark-factory closed loop"}]},{"id":"blk-21555","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20712","text":"The north-star use case for this stack is the "},{"id":"spn-20713","marks":["bold"],"text":"dark factory"},{"id":"spn-20714","text":": agents hosted on machines that operate autonomously, learn continually, and transfer skills to each other. Seven steps close the loop:"}]},{"id":"blk-21556","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  1. Machine A perceives & acts           ←  body-browser     │\n  │                                              body-os         │\n  │  2. Records InteractionTrace             ←  Graphonomous     │\n  │     (&memory.episodic.store)                                 │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  3. Learns via memory consolidation       ←  Graphonomous    │\n  │     (consolidation, κ-routing)                               │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  4. Crystallizes to SkillCandidate        ←  FleetPrompt     │\n  │     (Crystallizer + Oban PollWorker +                        │\n  │      GraphonomousClient.HTTP)                                │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  5. Ships via FleetPrompt                 ←  FleetPrompt     │\n  │     (Registry, Trust, InstallEngine)                         │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  6. Machine B installs + replays          ←  body-browser    │\n  │     (with fresh authorization on             body-os         │\n  │      destructive edges per OS-011 §4.4)      delegatic       │\n  │                                              (authorizer)    │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  7. PRISM measures                        ←  PRISM           │\n  │     (OS-011 scenario suite,                                  │\n  │      BYOR cross-system benchmark)                            │\n  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"},{"id":"blk-21557","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20715","text":"Current status (see "},{"id":"spn-20716","marks":["code"],"text":"STACK_COMPLETION.md"},{"id":"spn-20717","text":" for always-live detail): "},{"id":"spn-20718","marks":["bold"],"text":"7 of 7 steps fully in-tree"},{"id":"spn-20719","text":". Every step has implemented code paths, passing tests, and (for the MCP-exposed pieces) deployment configs."}]},{"id":"blk-21558","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20720","text":"Product map"}]},{"id":"blk-21559","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20721","text":"Shipping products"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-21561","spans":[{"id":"spn-20722","text":"Product"}]},{"id":"blk-21562","spans":[{"id":"spn-20723","text":"Role in the loop"}]},{"id":"blk-21563","spans":[{"id":"spn-20724","text":"Transport"}]},{"id":"blk-21564","spans":[{"id":"spn-20725","text":"Test count"}]}],"id":"blk-21560","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-21565","spans":[{"id":"spn-20726","text":"Graphonomous"}]},{"id":"blk-21566","spans":[{"id":"spn-20727","text":"episodic memory + continual learning engine"}]},{"id":"blk-21567","spans":[{"id":"spn-20728","text":"MCP (stdio/HTTP)"}]},{"id":"blk-21568","spans":[{"id":"spn-20729","text":"573"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21569","spans":[{"id":"spn-20730","text":"PULSE"}]},{"id":"blk-21570","spans":[{"id":"spn-20731","text":"temporal loop manifest standard"}]},{"id":"blk-21571","spans":[{"id":"spn-20732","text":"npm package"}]},{"id":"blk-21572","spans":[{"id":"spn-20733","text":"3"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21573","spans":[{"id":"spn-20734","text":"PRISM"}]},{"id":"blk-21574","spans":[{"id":"spn-20735","text":"cross-system CL benchmark"}]},{"id":"blk-21575","spans":[{"id":"spn-20736","text":"MCP + LiveView"}]},{"id":"blk-21576","spans":[{"id":"spn-20737","text":"172"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21577","spans":[{"id":"spn-20738","text":"[&] reference"}]},{"id":"blk-21578","spans":[{"id":"spn-20739","text":"protocol spec + Elixir CLI"}]},{"id":"blk-21579","spans":[{"id":"spn-20740","text":"CLI"}]},{"id":"blk-21580","spans":[{"id":"spn-20741","text":"58"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21581","spans":[{"id":"spn-20742","text":"body-browser"}]},{"id":"blk-21582","spans":[{"id":"spn-20743","marks":["code"],"text":"&body.browser"},{"id":"spn-20744","text":" provider (OS-011)"}]},{"id":"blk-21583","spans":[{"id":"spn-20745","text":"MCP (stdio/HTTP)"}]},{"id":"blk-21584","spans":[{"id":"spn-20746","text":"41"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21585","spans":[{"id":"spn-20747","text":"body-os"}]},{"id":"blk-21586","spans":[{"id":"spn-20748","marks":["code"],"text":"&body.os"},{"id":"spn-20749","text":" provider (OS-011)"}]},{"id":"blk-21587","spans":[{"id":"spn-20750","text":"MCP (stdio/HTTP)"}]},{"id":"blk-21588","spans":[{"id":"spn-20751","text":"41"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21589","spans":[{"id":"spn-20752","marks":["bold"],"text":"delegatic"}]},{"id":"blk-21590","spans":[{"id":"spn-20753","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-006 authorization kernel"}]},{"id":"blk-21591","spans":[{"id":"spn-20754","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP (stdio/HTTP)"}]},{"id":"blk-21592","spans":[{"id":"spn-20755","marks":["bold"],"text":"42"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-21593","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20756","text":"Progressing products (4)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-21595","spans":[{"id":"spn-20757","text":"Product"}]},{"id":"blk-21596","spans":[{"id":"spn-20758","text":"Role"}]},{"id":"blk-21597","spans":[{"id":"spn-20759","text":"Tests"}]}],"id":"blk-21594","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-21598","spans":[{"id":"spn-20760","text":"Agentelic"}]},{"id":"blk-21599","spans":[{"id":"spn-20761","text":"spec-driven agent builder"}]},{"id":"blk-21600","spans":[{"id":"spn-20762","text":"66"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21601","spans":[{"id":"spn-20763","text":"FleetPrompt"}]},{"id":"blk-21602","spans":[{"id":"spn-20764","text":"marketplace + trust + install + crystallizer"}]},{"id":"blk-21603","spans":[{"id":"spn-20765","text":"121 (108 + 13 install tests)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21604","spans":[{"id":"spn-20766","text":"SpecPrompt"}]},{"id":"blk-21605","spans":[{"id":"spn-20767","text":"spec-driven dev toolchain"}]},{"id":"blk-21606","spans":[{"id":"spn-20768","text":"93"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21607","spans":[{"id":"spn-20769","text":"RuneFort"}]},{"id":"blk-21608","spans":[{"id":"spn-20770","text":"spatial cognition visualization (SvelteKit)"}]},{"id":"blk-21609","spans":[{"id":"spn-20771","text":"—"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-21610","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20772","text":"Frontend apps (2)"}]},{"id":"blk-21611","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20773","text":"WebHost.Systems (React dashboard, 143 tests) and BendScript (SvelteKit KAG editor, 26 tests)."}]},{"id":"blk-21612","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20774","text":"Spec-only (5)"}]},{"id":"blk-21613","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20775","text":"AgenTroMatic (1118-line spec), Delegatic (630), Deliberatic (418), GeoFleetic (987), TickTickClock (1013)."}]},{"id":"blk-21614","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20776","text":"The three protocols in depth"}]},{"id":"blk-21615","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20777","text":"All three fit together as a three-layer stack:"}]},{"id":"blk-21616","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-21618","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20778","marks":["bold"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-20779","text":" (composition) — agents declare what capabilities they have via "},{"id":"spn-20780","marks":["code"],"text":".ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-20781","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-21617","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-21620","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20782","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE"},{"id":"spn-20783","text":" (temporal) — agents declare how their capabilities circulate via "},{"id":"spn-20784","marks":["code"],"text":".pulse.json"},{"id":"spn-20785","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-21619","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-21622","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20786","marks":["bold"],"text":"PRISM"},{"id":"spn-20787","text":" (diagnostic) — benchmarks measure the loops over time."}]}],"id":"blk-21621","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-21623","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20788","text":"Example: Graphonomous declares its continual-learning loop in "},{"id":"spn-20789","marks":["code"],"text":"PULSE/manifests/graphonomous.continual_learning.json"},{"id":"spn-20790","text":"; PRISM reads that manifest directly to discover phases, signatures, and substrates — no separate benchmark config needed."}]},{"id":"blk-21624","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20791","text":"Shared infrastructure"}]},{"id":"blk-21625","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-21627","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20792","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supabase"},{"id":"spn-20793","text":": single shared instance, "},{"id":"spn-20794","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.*"},{"id":"spn-20795","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-20796","marks":["code"],"text":"kag.*"},{"id":"spn-20797","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-20798","marks":["code"],"text":"webhost.*"},{"id":"sp